<title>LITHUANIA: C.BANK REGISTERS LITIMPEKS' SHARE CAPITAL.</title>
<headline>C.BANK REGISTERS LITIMPEKS' SHARE CAPITAL.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's central bank said on Thursday that its board had registered Litimpeks Bank's new share capital, which it devalued to 4.09 million litas from 40.9 million litas.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for the bank told Reuters that the registeration paves the way for Litimpeks Bank to boost its share capital with a planned 60 million litas issue.</p>
<p>The bank is seeking a major outside investor and is negotiating with a number of foreign and local banks.</p>
<p>--Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 18</p>
</text>
